{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0174_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b393b9dd2b55b67822d18cae2d36f4436e4db60d0ae1ac33adb63615a7639c36", "ja": "（茜が新しい衣装を着て、楽しそうにしている。\nフィッティングはもう終わったはずだけど……）", "zh": "（茜穿着新衣服，看起来很开心。\n试装应该已经结束了才对……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0174_1001_023aka", "source_sha256": "4443f58d3287773a8a54904e9b6db22b177c3e13a159080efe5d8267d52b64c6", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}ちゃん！\nお疲れさま、茜ちゃんに何か用？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n辛苦啦，是有什么事要找小茜吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0174_1002_023aka", "source_sha256": "f7f94bc490b52a238d20de153a3339265c0fb5efdb6f40782ae0979f39a82c4a", "ja": "もしかして、茜ちゃんのカワイイ衣装姿が\nまた見たくなっちゃったのかな？　そうなんでしょ？", "zh": "难道是又想看\n小茜穿可爱服装的样子了？对不对？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0174_1003_p", "source_sha256": "b5df36f334ed2710fa02d5725aa1890beb790ba24d8ef43dfea6bed1c48f5454", "ja": "お疲れさま、茜。茜こそ、フィッティングは\n終わったのに、また衣装を着て……どうしたんだ？", "zh": "辛苦了，茜。倒是你，试装都结束了，怎么又穿上演出服了……这是怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0174_1004_023aka", "source_sha256": "043efc6fcdfb5476451006011c3ca786260f286ebe07c70de73e97eee8581ccf", "ja": "もちろん、茜ちゃんのかわいさを全世界に\n伝えるために、パワーを高めてるんだよ♪", "zh": "当然是为了把小茜的可爱传遍全世界，正在提升力量呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0174_1005_023aka", "source_sha256": "d4f5f4fc8afd5d7151f2d388ef9a967f35a1c1c22fa8042db0495672f2a9b237", "ja": "茜ちゃんの魅力を解放するプレミアムな衣装を着る\nことで、パワー的なものが膨れ上がっていくのだ～！", "zh": "穿上能释放小茜魅力的高级服装后，某种力量就不断膨胀啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0174_1006_023aka", "source_sha256": "d19b6234da1b824ff53907244c72a424ba54c060e7c3714194e1691f76bc86d5", "ja": "さすが{$P$}ちゃん！　いつも\n茜ちゃんのことで頭がいっぱいなだけあるよね♪", "zh": "不愧是{$P$}！难怪你总是满脑子都是小茜呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0174_1007_p", "source_sha256": "a33cd39543a64bd710e8a1951bd24a39340201300c393ce80ee7703cfa7eff92", "ja": "いや、それだけでもないけど……\n何であれ、気に入ってくれたのならよかったよ。", "zh": "不，倒也不全是那样……\n不过不管怎样，只要你喜欢就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0174_1008_023aka", "source_sha256": "feebdea745674fe8e0548427aa13b5ab9ee6f9b31ccdffa996bdd2dc77e24987", "ja": "もちろんだよ！　だからご褒美に、\n茜ちゃんをナデナデさせてあげるよ！　カモン！", "zh": "那当然啦！所以作为奖励，\n就允许你摸摸小茜的头吧！来吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0174_1009_p", "source_sha256": "84903b564e661aabb6f646af26079669e9a061eddb8bbe2676ef73e1f3f03d11", "ja": "いつもの事だけど、俺が撫でる側なのか？", "zh": "虽然一直都是这样，但为什么是我来摸？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0174_1010_023aka", "source_sha256": "3a2da3777fff894f005e6489fd93a6e2a2b1b3bec7d4ceba6f0eee571f6be4f9", "ja": "カワイイ茜ちゃんをナデナデできるのは、\n全人類共通のご褒美でしょ？　それに……。", "zh": "能摸摸可爱的小茜，\n可是全人类共同的奖励吧？而且……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0174_1011_023aka", "source_sha256": "068ab2363f66bd8a4bc1ff3df33c54a30aa48b4619cc59a859a088f90fa3904f", "ja": "プレミアムな衣装を着たプレミアム茜ちゃんを\n撫でられるのは、今日限りだからね☆", "zh": "今天可是最后一天能抚摸穿着高级服装的高级小茜了哦☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0174_1012_023aka", "source_sha256": "fdd0f3c5d0b66a9d1a282d370b79d1c339269adb97983a6d2994b390e2acdb0c", "ja": "よかったね、{$P$}ちゃん！\n茜ちゃんのファンなら、泣いて喜ぶ最高のご褒美だよ！", "zh": "太好了，{$P$}！\n如果是小茜的粉丝，肯定会高兴得哭出来，这是最棒的奖励哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0174_1013_p", "source_sha256": "864b0f3db009ff0367de4f764ed2ad541713edbc24fc1035c9769355e10296c5", "ja": "そうか。でもご褒美なら、\n公演が終わってからのほうがいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "这样啊。不过既然是奖励，等公演结束后再给不是更好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0174_1014_023aka", "source_sha256": "8190621bc9bdf748bbc84e29e08191c8803cc2357f5179de39674c4d3172f2ac", "ja": "いやいや、今！　今であることが重要なんだよ！\nモチベーション的な意味で！", "zh": "不是不是，就是现在！现在才是最重要的！\n从激励的角度来说！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0174_1015_023aka", "source_sha256": "89950fd44d20bfab3ac029f98aabd6eb215b8c6f174813a803bf977a0d9079f1", "ja": "だから、思う存分ナデナデしていいんだよ？\nご褒美でモチベを高めて、茜ちゃんを輝かせよう！", "zh": "所以，尽情摸摸也没关系哦？\n用奖励提升干劲，让小茜闪耀起来吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0174_1016_p", "source_sha256": "727bc79b4ec749c1b49db8ceb3fcfeb2b8cd73a688c1c27801a006b44344c4a8", "ja": "最終的に本心が色々漏れてる気がするけど……\nまぁ、それで茜がやる気になってくれるなら。", "zh": "总感觉最后说着说着真心话都漏出来了……\n不过，要是这样能让茜干劲十足的话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
