{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0174_2000_023aka", "source_sha256": "5fe4a8b18bb417f095888c782ba026a94f0358db5b4479f2c0097b9e36fd3deb", "ja": "ふにゃぁ～～～♪　ゴロゴロゴロ……。\n……茜ちゃん、パワー、アーップ！", "zh": "喵呜～～～♪　呼噜呼噜……。\n……小茜，力量提升！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
